    "summary": "**[Plasma Warhead](vsdata:weapon-ability/plasma-warhead)**. In your Shooting phase, this weapon can fire only if the bearer **Remained Stationary** and neither placed nor moved the **Deathstrike Missile** marker that turn. Instead of choosing targets as usual, target every unit within 6 inches of the marker’s centre. Roll the attack count and resolve the attacks separately for each target.",
